{"id":"5004fbd0d7f0c9a1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFreeRow.md","title":"FFreeRow","display":"FFreeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FFreeRow","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","z1267","z1268","z1269"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FFreeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>z1267</span><span>z1268</span><span>z1269</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>z1267</code>、<code>z1268</code>、<code>z1269</code>。</p>\n<p>命名变量的自由出现；量词遮蔽同名变量。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FFreeRow E F R f r z1267 z1268 z1269)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists x\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair x t z1269)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat x)\n        (and\n          (@ FFm E F R f r t)\n          (or\n            (exists z1272\n              (exists z1273\n                (exists z1274\n                  (exists z1275\n                    (exists z1276\n                      (and\n                        (@ FRel z1272 z1273 t)\n                        (and (@ Seq z1273 z1274) (and (in z1275 z1274) (and (@ App z1273 z1275 z1276) (@ FTFree F f x z1276))))))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z1277\n                (exists z1278 (and (@ FEq z1277 z1278 t) (or (@ FTFree F f x z1277) (@ FTFree F f x z1278)))))\n              (or\n                (exists z1277\n                  (and\n                    (@ PNeg z1277 t)\n                    (exists z1280\n                      (exists z1281 (and (in z1280 z1268) (and (@ App z1267 z1280 z1281) (@ Pair x z1277 z1281)))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z1277\n                    (exists z1278\n                      (and\n                        (@ PImp z1277 z1278 t)\n                        (or\n                          (exists z1282\n                            (exists z1283 (and (in z1282 z1268) (and (@ App z1267 z1282 z1283) (@ Pair x z1277 z1283)))))\n                          (exists z1284\n                            (exists z1285 (and (in z1284 z1268) (and (@ App z1267 z1284 z1285) (@ Pair x z1278 z1285)))))))))\n                  (exists z1279\n                    (exists z1277\n                      (and\n                        (@ FAll z1279 z1277 t)\n                        (and\n                          (not (= z1279 x))\n                          (exists z1286\n                            (exists z1287 (and (in z1286 z1268) (and (@ App z1267 z1286 z1287) (@ Pair x z1277 z1287))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"372f265dbb09b97a\" href=\"?note=372f265dbb09b97a\" title=\"ZFC_FRel\">FRel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" href=\"?note=d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" title=\"ZFC_FTFree\">FTFree</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e2136a